  "body": "In particular:\n- “in a document” -> “in a document tree”\n- “in a shadow-including document” -> “is connected”\n- “node is connected” -> “becomes connected”\n- “node is disconnected” -> “becomes disconnected”\n\nFixes https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/238.\n",
